{"id":"360c9afc4431285e","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-substitution-evaluation.md","title":"替换与项解释交换","display":"thm-substitution-evaluation — 替换与项解释交换","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-substitution-evaluation","aliases":["56-thm-substitution-evaluation"],"display":"thm-substitution-evaluation — 替换与项解释交换","depends_on":["[[56-df-satisfaction]]","[[56-df-substitution-application]]"],"source_section":"7.1.12(i)","source_pages":"263","source_ocr_blocks":[284],"source_statement_status":"source-exercise-compared; local-derivation","source_proof_status":"local-structural-induction-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-substitution-evaluation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-substitution-evaluation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-substitution-evaluation — 替换与项解释交换"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b729ff69dbfa830d\" href=\"?note=b729ff69dbfa830d\" title=\"56-df-satisfaction\">56-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"7.1.12(i)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"263"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>284</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-exercise-compared; local-derivation"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-structural-induction-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 为本书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 的实例。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)\">\\(\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in A^V\">\\(\\beta\\in A^V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in T\">\\(t\\in T\\)</span>。项解释见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b729ff69dbfa830d\" href=\"?note=b729ff69dbfa830d\" title=\"56-df-satisfaction\">56-df-satisfaction</a>，替换应用见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\beta_\\sigma\\coloneqq\\{(x,\\sigma(x)^{(A,I)}[\\beta]):x\\in V\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\beta_\\sigma\\coloneqq\\{(x,\\sigma(x)^{(A,I)}[\\beta]):x\\in V\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\beta_\\sigma\\in A^V\\land(t\\sigma)^{(A,I)}[\\beta]=t^{(A,I)}[\\beta_\\sigma].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\beta_\\sigma\\in A^V\\land(t\\sigma)^{(A,I)}[\\beta]=t^{(A,I)}[\\beta_\\sigma].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Exercise 7.1.12(i)，本地按项结构归纳完成推导。变量分支两边都为σ(x)的解释；函数分支将各参数的归纳等式代入I(f)。零元分支使用同一常元解释。一般替换可以有无限支持，证明只访问t中有限多个变量。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003，7.1.12(i)，印刷页 263。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 为本地DjVu文字层页块序号，不是物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"b729ff69dbfa830d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-application]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"b729ff69dbfa830d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$V$ 为本书 $\\mathcal V$ 的实例。给定 $\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)$、$\\beta\\in A^V$、$\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)$、$t\\in T$。项解释见 [[56-df-satisfaction]]，替换应用见 [[56-df-substitution-application]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$V$ 为本书 $\\mathcal V$ 的实例。给定 $\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)$、$\\beta\\in A^V$、$\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)$、$t\\in T$。项解释见 [[56-df-satisfaction]]，替换应用见 [[56-df-substitution-application]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in A^V","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_\\sigma\\coloneqq\\{(x,\\sigma(x)^{(A,I)}[\\beta]):x\\in V\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\beta_\\sigma\\in A^V\\land(t\\sigma)^{(A,I)}[\\beta]=t^{(A,I)}[\\beta_\\sigma].","display":true}],"bytes":1558,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-253","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-substitution-evaluation.md]]"},{"id":"b2200b3a7e14635b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["b729ff69dbfa830d","6aa7f56f36c897f4"]}